    /// own, owned by their own work and their own threat-model extension, and going through a page's
    /// submit control is not a licence to start one. DOCUMENT_ADVANCED is the mirror of NO_MUTATION and
    /// is what an ordinary activation claims: the browser cannot know what a page's own control does,
    /// so the only honest claim a synthetic click can make is that the document moved past the dispatch
    /// it was given. Until 0.14 an activation could declare nothing weaker than an exact node state,
    /// which meant a click was authorized only against a disclosure control and every ordinary button
    /// on the web was unreachable. Closed enumeration: a consumer that receives a value outside this
    /// list MUST treat the message as unsupported and fail closed, and MUST NOT coerce the value to a
    /// known member (protocol section 6.2).
